1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:06,880
Every Caltrain rider knows the question: is my train on time, and when do I really have to leave?

2
00:00:06,880 --> 00:00:15,510
Headway answers it on your phone, your watch and your Even G2 glasses, from Caltrain's live feed.

3
00:00:15,510 --> 00:00:21,890
Set your commute once: where you get on, where you get off, and how long your walk to the station takes.

4
00:00:21,890 --> 00:00:26,300
The Trains tab shows your next trains, with live delays.

5
00:00:26,300 --> 00:00:31,700
The Catch card counts down to when you have to leave, walk included.

6
00:00:33,160 --> 00:00:39,990
To see it on your glasses, get a pairing code in the Glasses tab, and type it into the Even app, once.

7
00:00:39,990 --> 00:00:45,500
Now your commute is right in front of you: the next trains, delays, and when to leave.

8
00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:49,280
Swipe on the R1 ring to move through the trains.

9
00:00:49,280 --> 00:00:53,060
Tap to flip the direction, for the ride home.

10
00:00:53,060 --> 00:00:59,040
Hold for the menu: track a train, pick stations, or read alerts.

11
00:01:00,040 --> 00:01:05,250
When delays stack up, the next train out is not always the first one home.

12
00:01:05,250 --> 00:01:10,950
Headway spots it, and tells you to wait for the 511 Express.

13
00:01:10,950 --> 00:01:14,010
Your glasses show the same advice,

14
00:01:14,610 --> 00:01:20,570
and a time-sensitive alert reaches you, before you board the slow one.

15
00:01:21,910 --> 00:01:24,570
Swipe a train and tap Track.

16
00:01:24,640 --> 00:01:31,050
Share live ETA sends a private link, so whoever is waiting knows when you will arrive.

17
00:01:31,050 --> 00:01:36,930
They see your train and its arrival time, with no app and no sign in.

18
00:01:36,930 --> 00:01:42,090
Your ride follows you to the Dynamic Island and the Lock Screen.

19
00:01:42,090 --> 00:01:47,350
And five minutes out, a tap tells you it is time to get ready.

20
00:01:48,970 --> 00:01:53,650
Know when to leave, see it at a glance, and skip the slow train.

21
00:01:53,650 --> 00:01:57,490
Headway. Your next Caltrain, at a glance.
